  talkFramerate: 6
  adviceLines:
  - '* Say,^05 if you''re feeling a bit\n  tired,^05 why not take a break?'
  - '* The <color=#FFFF00FF>bright light</color> will allow you\n  to SAVE your progress.'
  - '* You can return back here at any\n  time!'
  - '* Bright light?'
  - '* Is there something I''m\n  missing here?'
